Standard-Model-structure lemmas used by the the private research repository reviews.

Status conventions: a theorem in this library is PROVED only in the sense that the
Lean kernel accepts it from the standard axioms (`propext`, `Classical.choice`,
`Quot.sound`); see `AxiomsAll.lean` and `AXIOMS.md`. Physics readings in docstrings
(e.g. "hidden zero", "anomaly cancellation") are interpretations of the stated
algebraic facts, not further claims. Anything labelled CITED, SIMULATED, CONJECTURE
or SPECULATION in a docstring is not proved here. `FRONTIER-AXIOM` items, where
present, enter only as explicit hypotheses of the theorems that use them.
